      "notes": "\"Major electives totaling at least six or eight units depending on the lab course chosen for requirement eight above (a total of forty-eight upper-division units is required for completion of the major).\" \"A major elective is defined as an upper-division biology course taken through the UC San Diego School of Biological Sciences.\""
